WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.277
Equivalent ratios multiply or divide BOTH parts by the same positive factor.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:11.724
Write an equivalent ratio to 1:2 using factor 4. The answer is 4:8. Multiply both

00:00:11.724 --> 00:00:13.967
parts by 4 to get 4:8.

00:00:14.783 --> 00:00:20.410
A recipe on a football field mixes fruit and water in the ratio 8:5. Which ratio

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:25.333
keeps the same taste when quantities are multiplied by 3? Pause to choose and

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:25.685
explain.

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:32.731
A recipe on a football field mixes fruit and water in the ratio 8:5. Which ratio

00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:38.154
keeps the same taste when quantities are multiplied by 3? The answer is 24:15.

00:00:38.154 --> 00:00:41.253
Multiply both parts by 3 to get 24:15.
